        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In this section we determine the adjacency spectrum of the line graph  $ L(BL_n(k - 1, k)) $. We first compute the spectrum of  $ BL_n(k - 1, k) $ itself (Theorem 3.1), and then use Lemma 2.1 to derive the spectrum of its line graph in the two cases  $ n \\geq 2k $ (Theorem 3.2) and  $ n = 2k - 1 $ (Theorem 3.4).",
